WEBVTT

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:20.812
After I finish you, your friend is next.

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:23.773
For the sake of our perfect world,

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:26.651
our perfect Sorcerer Kingdom.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:28.820
And now you die!

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.869
What happened?

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.129
That bridge
is completely destroyed!

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.630
The blast was incredible!

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.133
That… that spell, it's…

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.135
It must be him.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:56.139
You guessed it.
I'm that incredibly handsome young hero…

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:59.225
The one and only Dark Schneider.

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.403
I don't believe it!

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:36.447
He's a scourge
on the Kingdom of Meta-llicana!

00:02:36.531 --> 00:02:38.324
That monster blew up the bridge

00:02:38.408 --> 00:02:41.161
and destroyed the front arch
and main gate!

00:02:41.244 --> 00:02:42.245
Don't worry.

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:45.957
Now that the bridge is destroyed,
the main gate isn't important anyway.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.793
And besides,
we were prepared to survive a siege.

00:02:48.877 --> 00:02:51.921
And he killed hundreds
of enemy soldiers in a single attack.

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:54.507
-Hmm.
-I suppose you're right about that.

00:02:54.591 --> 00:02:56.426
I can barely believe my eyes.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:58.386
The ninjas have all run away.

00:02:58.887 --> 00:03:01.890
<i>I didn't realize he still had such power.</i>

00:03:01.973 --> 00:03:03.850
<i>The man is terrifying.</i>

00:03:06.477 --> 00:03:08.354
How'd you like that cool, new spell?

00:03:08.438 --> 00:03:09.647
I call it "Helloween."

00:03:09.731 --> 00:03:10.940
It's incredible, right?

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:13.401
I mean, did you see
how I took down the bridge like that?

00:03:13.484 --> 00:03:15.403
Once I get a better handle
on how to control it,

00:03:15.486 --> 00:03:17.363
that spell's gonna be a badass.

00:03:17.947 --> 00:03:19.449
<i>Dark Schneider.</i>

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.826
Damn you, Dark Schneider.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.995
You nearly killed me. You know that?

00:03:25.288 --> 00:03:26.539
Sorry about that!

00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:28.875
I still have a few bugs
to work out, you know?

00:03:28.958 --> 00:03:30.376
You goddamn idiot!

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.212
Go try your spells somewhere else!

00:03:32.295 --> 00:03:33.504
Not around me!

00:03:33.588 --> 00:03:35.006
I'll get you for this!

00:03:35.089 --> 00:03:37.842
You hear me?
I'm gonna kill you! Count on it!

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:40.803
It is him.

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.263
It's Dark Schneider.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.475
Hey, Arshes. What's wrong?

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:47.477
Why do you see me as your enemy?

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.062
<i>So, that's her.</i>

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:50.688
<i>Arshes Nei.</i>

00:03:51.314 --> 00:03:52.815
<i>Lucien's lover.</i>

00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:55.068
<i>She's beautiful.</i>

00:03:55.151 --> 00:03:57.570
<i>He's with another woman.</i>
<i>Of course.</i>

00:03:58.196 --> 00:04:01.741
<i>Just like before. He never changes.</i>

00:04:04.535 --> 00:04:07.205
<i>I would always wait for you to come back</i>

00:04:07.288 --> 00:04:10.500
<i>when you would go out</i>
<i>running around with all those women.</i>

00:04:12.543 --> 00:04:16.547
<i>You came back to life,</i>
<i>and you still keep hurting me.</i>

00:04:16.631 --> 00:04:19.676
<i>But this is the last time</i>
<i>that's ever going to happen.</i>

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:21.844
<i>I'm going to end your life forever.</i>

00:04:23.972 --> 00:04:24.806
Huh?

00:04:24.889 --> 00:04:26.516
Arshes.

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:28.476
Let me go!

00:04:28.559 --> 00:04:31.521
Oh. You're not really thinking
about killing me?

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:33.898
That's bad manners, right?

00:04:33.982 --> 00:04:36.359
Just shut up! I am going to kill you!

00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:38.111
You'll never come back to life again!

00:04:38.194 --> 00:04:39.320
Now, now.

00:04:42.365 --> 00:04:44.575
Whatever has gotten into you?

00:04:44.659 --> 00:04:48.454
When did you start talking back
to your mentor like that, huh?

00:04:50.039 --> 00:04:53.376
You're not being the type of girl
I raised you to be, are you?

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:55.795
You know I love you. That hasn't changed.

00:05:13.938 --> 00:05:15.565
I know all your hotspots.

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:18.276
You remember, don't you?
Come on. You know I do.

00:05:18.359 --> 00:05:19.569
Am I right? You still like it?

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.362
I don't want…

00:05:21.446 --> 00:05:23.531
Oh my God! Please stop!

00:05:23.614 --> 00:05:26.492
<i>I can't die.</i>

00:05:28.995 --> 00:05:29.996
Arshes.

00:05:31.039 --> 00:05:34.208
You've done the same thing
to Sean and Kai, haven't you?

00:05:34.292 --> 00:05:35.710
And many more.

00:05:35.793 --> 00:05:37.920
Please don't lie to me again.

00:05:38.629 --> 00:05:40.131
Don't be foolish.

00:05:40.214 --> 00:05:42.008
We were together for 100 years.

00:05:42.091 --> 00:05:44.302
I've always loved you the most.

00:05:44.802 --> 00:05:45.970
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:05:46.054 --> 00:05:48.389
<i>I can't believe I'm going to die here!</i>

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:50.433
<i>Darsh…</i>

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:53.519
Oh, Darsh.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:00.735
Arshes Nei,
you must be very careful with him.

00:06:00.818 --> 00:06:02.195
The nail is watching.

00:06:02.779 --> 00:06:04.614
<i>Never forget these words.</i>

00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:08.493
<i>If you ever find that you've opened</i>
<i>your heart to Dark Schneider…</i>

00:06:09.619 --> 00:06:13.247
<i>Oh no.</i>
<i>The nail went from blue to purple.</i>

00:06:13.331 --> 00:06:17.168
The moment
the cursed nail becomes crimson red,

00:06:17.251 --> 00:06:19.379
<i>you will breathe your last breath.</i>

00:06:19.879 --> 00:06:22.840
<i>Your body will be torn into pieces,</i>

00:06:22.924 --> 00:06:26.969
<i>and you will turn into a lowly,</i>
<i>helpless toad for all eternity.</i>

00:06:28.346 --> 00:06:30.014
Is that really how you feel?

00:06:30.098 --> 00:06:31.849
Get your hands off of me!

00:06:32.809 --> 00:06:33.976
Hmm?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.561
How could I fall for this?

00:06:35.645 --> 00:06:37.897
I'll never believe
another word you say again.

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.233
You're nothing
but a filthy, deceitful liar!

00:06:40.316 --> 00:06:41.984
Arshes? What are you doing?

00:06:47.407 --> 00:06:49.867
Once I rebuild my army, I'll be back!

00:06:49.951 --> 00:06:50.993
Count on it!

00:06:51.619 --> 00:06:53.371
When I make my return,

00:06:53.454 --> 00:06:56.290
the Kingdom of Meta-llicana
will meet it's downfall,

00:06:56.374 --> 00:06:57.834
and you will meet your death!

00:06:57.917 --> 00:06:58.751
Huh?

00:06:58.835 --> 00:07:02.922
Princess… Your Majesty,
the enemy is retreating! It's incredible!

00:07:03.005 --> 00:07:05.967
We've beaten them!
Our kingdom is safe!

00:07:07.135 --> 00:07:08.636
There's something wrong with her.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.680
<i>Why did she…</i>

00:07:13.641 --> 00:07:14.809
<i>Damn him.</i>

00:07:14.892 --> 00:07:16.310
<i>How can I be so stupid?</i>

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:19.272
<i>We lived together for 100 years.</i>

00:07:20.982 --> 00:07:23.651
<i>He told me he loved me 1,000 times.</i>

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:29.657
<i>There's not a single inch of my body</i>
<i>his fingers and lips haven't touched.</i>

00:07:33.369 --> 00:07:37.290
<i>You stole my disciples</i>
<i>and you're destroying my utopia.</i>

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.750
<i>But none of that matters anymore.</i>

00:07:39.834 --> 00:07:41.377
<i>I'm going to kill you!</i>

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.466
<i>I am going to kill you!</i>

00:07:46.549 --> 00:07:48.176
<i>No matter what it takes!</i>

00:07:52.555 --> 00:07:55.183
I have to say, you look like shit.

00:07:55.266 --> 00:07:56.642
Why don't you shut up?

00:07:56.726 --> 00:07:59.479
I know you wanted
to see the Raijinken in battle,

00:07:59.562 --> 00:08:01.856
but you were up against Arshes.

00:08:01.939 --> 00:08:03.357
You gotta listen to me.

00:08:03.441 --> 00:08:05.234
Don't underestimate Nei.

00:08:05.318 --> 00:08:09.572
She's honed her abilities to a degree
you couldn't imagine 15 years ago.

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:13.034
Her swordsmanship has improved,
and so has her magic.

00:08:13.117 --> 00:08:17.205
You think you know everything about her,
but if you get careless, you're dead.

00:08:17.288 --> 00:08:18.915
<i>What does he know about her?</i>

00:08:18.998 --> 00:08:20.208
Thanks, octopus.

00:08:20.291 --> 00:08:22.585
I appreciate you worrying about that,

00:08:22.668 --> 00:08:26.005
but I think you should pay attention
to getting your bad ass out of bed soon.

00:08:26.589 --> 00:08:27.798
I can manage.

00:08:27.882 --> 00:08:30.384
And I'm sure as hell not worried
about you.

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:34.222
<i>Lucien and the Empress,</i>

00:08:34.305 --> 00:08:37.016
<i>I wonder what happened between them?</i>

00:08:42.647 --> 00:08:44.357
This weather is a blessing.

00:08:45.608 --> 00:08:48.903
The Dark Rebel Army
won't attack as long as it rains.

00:08:48.986 --> 00:08:51.614
Let's hope it keeps up for a long time.

00:08:53.824 --> 00:08:55.576
Whoa! It's Yoko!

00:08:57.161 --> 00:08:59.539
Line up! There's plenty to go around.

00:09:02.542 --> 00:09:04.710
I'm glad to see you're enjoying the food.

00:09:04.794 --> 00:09:07.630
Yoko, you don't have
to serve me my food, I can do it myself.

00:09:07.713 --> 00:09:09.048
It's okay.

00:09:09.131 --> 00:09:12.093
I just wanna help out
wherever I can. Here.

00:09:12.677 --> 00:09:13.553
Eat up.

00:09:13.636 --> 00:09:15.429
Ugh. I'm exhausted.

00:09:15.513 --> 00:09:18.516
I've gotta go back to fixing the wall
as soon as I finish here.

00:09:18.599 --> 00:09:21.519
Sounds like a tough job.
Good luck with it. Here.

00:09:22.019 --> 00:09:24.730
You're working so hard, Yoko.
Aren't you tired?

00:09:24.814 --> 00:09:25.982
Not at all.

00:09:26.065 --> 00:09:28.401
Everyone's been working hard
without getting any sleep!

00:09:29.402 --> 00:09:32.780
I, uh… I'm going to be
on the watchtower for most of the day.

00:09:32.863 --> 00:09:35.324
Then you'll need some help.
Here. Have some extra soup.

00:09:35.408 --> 00:09:38.411
Yoko! Could I have
some extra meat in my bowl?

00:09:38.494 --> 00:09:39.662
Here you are!

00:09:50.047 --> 00:09:51.882
Huh? Wait a minute.

00:09:51.966 --> 00:09:54.427
That's it? How come I don't get any soup?

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:55.428
What's going on?

00:09:55.511 --> 00:09:57.096
Who do you think you are?

00:09:57.179 --> 00:09:59.890
Don't just stand there!
Move along! You're holding up the line!

00:10:04.353 --> 00:10:05.980
What's bugging her?

00:10:06.063 --> 00:10:08.065
<i>Boy, is she ever bitchy today.</i>

00:10:09.066 --> 00:10:12.486
<i>Okay. So I'll just eat it up fast</i>
<i>and get right back in line.</i>

00:10:15.072 --> 00:10:16.449
Uh…

00:10:19.619 --> 00:10:22.997
What's going on?
Why are you acting like this?

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.707
I can't believe you're being so mean!

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.375
Are you mad at me or something, Yoko?

00:10:26.459 --> 00:10:28.794
What makes you think I'm mad at you?

00:10:28.878 --> 00:10:32.548
Why don't you just use your magic
to make your food appear, huh?

00:10:32.632 --> 00:10:35.259
What?
You know I don't have that kind of spell!

00:10:37.845 --> 00:10:40.598
All right.
You just sit right here, Lucien.

00:10:43.059 --> 00:10:46.562
Okay, then.
I was hoping it wouldn't come to this.

00:10:48.731 --> 00:10:51.901
You're a wretched,
no-good, worthless horndog!

00:10:51.984 --> 00:10:54.445
I thought I told you not
to be such an unfaithful jerk,

00:10:54.528 --> 00:10:57.782
but then you went
and groped her, didn't you?

00:10:57.865 --> 00:11:00.910
And I'm guessing
there were lots of other times, hmm?

00:11:00.993 --> 00:11:02.119
Well, um…

00:11:03.204 --> 00:11:04.121
<i>Other times?</i>

00:11:04.205 --> 00:11:07.541
<i>There were so many. I don't know</i>
<i>which one she's talking about.</i>

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:14.090
Yeah, but you said it was okay,
that you didn't mind if I did.

00:11:14.173 --> 00:11:16.967
Don't you look at me
with that side-eye of yours!

00:11:17.968 --> 00:11:20.096
If you have something to say,
come out and say it.

00:11:20.179 --> 00:11:22.890
Okay. You really asked for it now.

00:11:23.391 --> 00:11:25.851
Yoko, you know you're really a--

00:11:25.935 --> 00:11:28.354
Yes? And?

00:11:28.854 --> 00:11:29.730
Uh,

00:11:30.398 --> 00:11:33.150
you, uh… you always butt into my business.

00:11:33.234 --> 00:11:35.152
I have my reasons, you know?

00:11:38.823 --> 00:11:39.949
What are you doing?

00:11:40.032 --> 00:11:42.451
Yoko, come on.
You're a virgin, aren't you?

00:11:42.535 --> 00:11:44.745
I'm never wrong.
I could tell from the smell.

00:11:44.829 --> 00:11:45.996
It makes me so crazy!

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.332
Get the hell away
from me, you bastard!

00:11:48.416 --> 00:11:49.917
You're disgusting!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.752
You make me sick!

00:11:53.796 --> 00:11:56.424
What? Are you gonna just sit there?
Get out of my sight!

00:12:00.094 --> 00:12:02.096
Yoko is really scary.

00:12:05.224 --> 00:12:07.309
<i>Lucien's such a moron.</i>

00:12:09.019 --> 00:12:12.690
Grandmother, the reason
for our visit to you here today

00:12:12.773 --> 00:12:15.401
is to ask you,
as prophet of the royal family,

00:12:15.484 --> 00:12:17.611
to use your powers to take a look

00:12:17.695 --> 00:12:21.574
at the kind of seal put on Dark Schneider
many years in the past.

00:12:21.657 --> 00:12:22.700
I see.

00:12:22.783 --> 00:12:27.037
Little Geo wants my help again
just like 15 years ago.

00:12:27.121 --> 00:12:29.373
You've turned into a strapping young lad,

00:12:29.457 --> 00:12:32.585
but you just can't figure
this thing out without my help.

00:12:32.668 --> 00:12:34.253
Some things never change.

00:12:35.379 --> 00:12:38.424
Grandmother, please don't call me
a young lad. I grew up.

00:12:38.507 --> 00:12:40.134
There's no refusing a request

00:12:40.217 --> 00:12:42.845
from the Great Priest
and the Princess, is there?

00:12:42.928 --> 00:12:43.888
So tell me.

00:12:43.971 --> 00:12:46.724
Grandmother, it's important we know.

00:12:46.807 --> 00:12:49.602
His safety will decide the fate
of our entire kingdom.

00:12:49.685 --> 00:12:52.104
I'm sure you're well aware that, uh,

00:12:52.188 --> 00:12:55.065
that Princess Sheila and Yoko, together,

00:12:55.149 --> 00:12:58.068
were able to break
Dark Schneider's seal three times already.

00:12:58.152 --> 00:13:02.823
<i>However, there were also two other times</i>
<i>when he was able to use his magic</i>

00:13:02.907 --> 00:13:06.118
<i>while still in the form</i>
<i>of the boy, Lucien Renlen.</i>

00:13:06.202 --> 00:13:10.831
And what's more, it was during that battle
with the Three Sorcerer Generals

00:13:10.915 --> 00:13:16.462
<i>that Dark Schneider surprised everyone</i>
<i>and broke the seal himself.</i>

00:13:18.589 --> 00:13:21.342
Hmm. That evil wizard.

00:13:21.425 --> 00:13:25.179
He's become so much stronger
than he was 15 years ago.

00:13:25.262 --> 00:13:26.555
It's terrifying.

00:13:26.639 --> 00:13:28.724
Remember the seal we placed?

00:13:28.808 --> 00:13:31.227
We did that
when you were still only a child.

00:13:31.811 --> 00:13:34.814
How did he break it
simply with his own willpower?

00:13:34.897 --> 00:13:36.148
I… I know.

00:13:36.232 --> 00:13:40.110
I thought it was impossible for
an evil person to break the sacred seal,

00:13:40.194 --> 00:13:42.613
no matter how strong
their willpower might be.

00:13:42.696 --> 00:13:44.573
Look carefully at this orb.

00:13:44.657 --> 00:13:47.868
Look carefully
at the color of the light shining from it.

00:13:48.869 --> 00:13:50.037
That means that…

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:53.916
This ethereal, blue light
tells me something that's very important.

00:13:53.999 --> 00:13:57.086
It tells me that the sacred seal
is in perfect condition

00:13:57.169 --> 00:13:58.754
and wasn't damaged in any way.

00:13:58.838 --> 00:14:02.758
But how… how did Dark Schneider manage
to break it then?

00:14:02.842 --> 00:14:05.636
The power behind the seal
comes from Ino Mata,

00:14:05.719 --> 00:14:07.847
the goddess of love and beauty.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:12.226
It's true it's impossible
for an evil person to break the seal.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.688
However, there might be one exception.

00:14:15.771 --> 00:14:20.359
If the person attempting
to break the seal has love in their heart,

00:14:20.442 --> 00:14:24.280
in other words, their intentions are pure,
honorable, and good,

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:30.202
then it could be possible that he might
have swayed the goddess' heart at the end.

00:14:30.286 --> 00:14:33.122
That's ridiculous.

00:14:33.205 --> 00:14:35.791
I agree it's difficult to believe,

00:14:35.875 --> 00:14:40.504
but I can only conclude that the heart
of that brutish, terrifying being,

00:14:40.588 --> 00:14:43.132
who knows nothing
but death and destruction,

00:14:43.215 --> 00:14:45.593
is somehow starting to find love.

00:14:45.676 --> 00:14:49.305
<i> I knew it.</i>
<i>It has to be because of Yoko.</i>

00:14:49.388 --> 00:14:51.140
Hmm?

00:14:51.223 --> 00:14:53.559
Something else is appearing. Look!

00:14:55.352 --> 00:14:57.271
What the… It's him!

00:14:57.354 --> 00:14:58.439
What it this?

00:14:59.315 --> 00:15:01.984
Dark Schneider's heart
has been ripped from his body!

00:15:02.067 --> 00:15:03.193
He's dead!

00:15:09.575 --> 00:15:11.911
<i>Maybe I went a little overboard.</i>

00:15:11.994 --> 00:15:13.579
<i>I shouldn't have talked like that.</i>

00:15:14.914 --> 00:15:17.791
<i>I can't believe</i>
<i>I actually threw a pan at him.</i>

00:15:17.875 --> 00:15:19.793
<i>There's no excuse for it.</i>

00:15:19.877 --> 00:15:21.754
<i>Why was I so mad?</i>

00:15:22.588 --> 00:15:23.672
A little tight.

00:15:23.756 --> 00:15:25.132
Uh, I'm sorry!

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:28.344
Are you worried
about something, little girl?

00:15:28.427 --> 00:15:29.595
I, um…

00:15:29.678 --> 00:15:32.056
I'm not worried about anything.
Why would you think that?

00:15:32.806 --> 00:15:34.099
You're right to worry.

00:15:34.183 --> 00:15:36.018
He's at a disadvantage against Nei.

00:15:36.101 --> 00:15:36.977
What?

00:15:37.061 --> 00:15:40.022
When it comes to fights
with high-level magic,

00:15:40.105 --> 00:15:42.983
and two forces of the same type collide,

00:15:43.067 --> 00:15:45.027
it generates a strong reaction.

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:47.821
In other words,
the force creates a counter-reaction

00:15:47.905 --> 00:15:51.742
that will repel
whichever of the two forces is weaker,

00:15:51.825 --> 00:15:53.160
and nullifies them.

00:15:54.161 --> 00:15:55.788
Which means they'll be killed.

00:15:58.582 --> 00:16:02.252
<i>Nei lived together</i>
<i>with Dark Schneider for 100 years.</i>

00:16:02.836 --> 00:16:07.424
<i>I had contact with her</i>
<i>about 15 years ago, and she was ruthless.</i>

00:16:08.008 --> 00:16:12.137
But now there's this kind of unfamiliar
gentleness to her I've never seen.

00:16:12.221 --> 00:16:15.557
Um, I just thought of something
I have to do.

00:16:17.977 --> 00:16:19.269
Hmm.

00:16:19.353 --> 00:16:20.646
<i>But, then again,</i>

00:16:20.729 --> 00:16:23.941
<i>that gentleness</i>
<i>has become one of her greatest strengths.</i>

00:16:24.692 --> 00:16:27.069
<i>Looks like the storm's going to get worse.</i>

00:16:29.863 --> 00:16:31.407
<i>He could die.</i>

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:33.492
<i>I'm not going to let that happen.</i>

00:16:33.575 --> 00:16:34.410
<i>Lucien…</i>

00:16:38.497 --> 00:16:40.332
<i>Princess Sheila?</i>

00:16:44.503 --> 00:16:46.463
Boy. It's really coming down.

00:16:47.047 --> 00:16:50.551
I have orders from the captain
to keep watch, but I can't see anything.

00:16:50.634 --> 00:16:52.344
Yeah. I know.

00:16:52.428 --> 00:16:54.763
But the enemy
can't move either in this storm.

00:16:54.847 --> 00:16:55.681
Yeah.

00:16:55.764 --> 00:16:59.393
Well, at least the lousy
weather's bought us a few more days.

00:17:01.228 --> 00:17:04.606
I can't believe
you're such a wuss, Sheila!

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:07.568
You actually fell for what you saw
in that old hag's glass ball?

00:17:07.651 --> 00:17:08.819
Are you kidding me?

00:17:08.902 --> 00:17:11.822
But her prophecies have been right
so many times before.

00:17:13.115 --> 00:17:15.784
You're supposed
to be sneaking into my bedroom.

00:17:15.868 --> 00:17:17.536
This whole thing's ridiculous.

00:17:17.619 --> 00:17:19.246
What are you…? Sneaking in?

00:17:19.329 --> 00:17:21.206
I have to hand it to that old hag.

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:23.500
I can't believe she's still alive.

00:17:24.001 --> 00:17:26.837
You know, she's the one
who sealed me away 15 years ago

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:28.630
with the help of the Great Priest?

00:17:28.714 --> 00:17:31.258
We're definitely gonna have
a showdown someday.

00:17:31.341 --> 00:17:36.096
I heard you took in Arshes Nei
when she was abandoned as a child.

00:17:37.848 --> 00:17:39.516
Or… Well, um…

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.019
The two of you must have been very close.

00:17:42.728 --> 00:17:44.146
I just don't understand.

00:17:44.229 --> 00:17:46.190
Why would you try to kill one another?

00:17:47.149 --> 00:17:48.442
<i>Sheila.</i>

00:17:48.525 --> 00:17:51.403
<i>Could it be? Does Princess Sheila…</i>

00:17:51.487 --> 00:17:52.654
Isn't there…

00:17:53.155 --> 00:17:56.992
Is there a way
that you could avoid this fight somehow?

00:17:57.951 --> 00:18:00.704
I'm afraid it's absolutely impossible.

00:18:00.788 --> 00:18:01.830
Just look.

00:18:01.914 --> 00:18:06.168
Look at the vortex in the orb,
swirling around like fierce lightning.

00:18:06.251 --> 00:18:08.504
Huh? So what is it?

00:18:08.587 --> 00:18:10.172
That is hatred.

00:18:10.255 --> 00:18:13.967
Arshes Nei's heart
is burning with anger and hatred!

00:18:14.051 --> 00:18:16.261
It's consuming her soul.

00:18:16.345 --> 00:18:18.305
There's no way to stop that fight now.

00:18:18.388 --> 00:18:20.349
There's no way on this earth.

00:18:21.225 --> 00:18:23.769
And you're going
to go ahead with the fight anyway?

00:18:23.852 --> 00:18:25.771
Even though you know you'll be killed?

00:18:25.854 --> 00:18:27.147
Don't be ridiculous.

00:18:27.231 --> 00:18:29.191
Nobody's gonna be doing any dying.

00:18:29.274 --> 00:18:30.818
There's not an ice cube's chance in hell

00:18:30.901 --> 00:18:33.737
that a dream boat like yours truly
could lose, much less, die.

00:18:34.863 --> 00:18:37.282
But I'm so worried.

00:18:38.534 --> 00:18:40.828
I'm worried
about what could happen to you.

00:18:41.328 --> 00:18:45.999
The ministers, they all believe
that you must be plotting something.

00:18:46.083 --> 00:18:48.210
Something terrible against the kingdom.

00:18:48.293 --> 00:18:51.547
But I don't.
I would never think that of you.

00:18:52.214 --> 00:18:55.509
I know it was you who sent Gara
to save this castle, wasn't it?

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:59.972
You've saved us from danger now
and so many other times

00:19:00.055 --> 00:19:01.765
that I can't even count them all.

00:19:03.517 --> 00:19:05.602
But… but most of all,

00:19:06.228 --> 00:19:10.315
I don't want to see you get hurt
just for Meta-llicana's sake anymore.

00:19:10.399 --> 00:19:13.443
I… I simply couldn't bear it.

00:19:17.114 --> 00:19:18.240
Huh?

00:19:18.323 --> 00:19:20.492
For the sake of this kingdom?

00:19:23.078 --> 00:19:24.705
Are you really that naive?

00:19:24.788 --> 00:19:26.623
Is that honestly what you thought?

00:19:26.707 --> 00:19:28.208
You gotta be out of your mind!

00:19:29.418 --> 00:19:30.544
Huh?

00:19:32.546 --> 00:19:35.757
Listen to me, Sheila.
I've been saying this over and over again.

00:19:35.841 --> 00:19:39.428
It's quite simple, really.
I wanna take over the world.

00:19:39.511 --> 00:19:40.721
That's all I want.

00:19:40.804 --> 00:19:42.556
I'm not fighting for any kingdom.

00:19:42.639 --> 00:19:44.558
I'm fighting for myself, you got that?

00:19:44.641 --> 00:19:46.059
Yes. Your ministers are right.

00:19:46.143 --> 00:19:49.229
I am plotting,
but it's to take back the Dark Rebel Army.

00:19:49.313 --> 00:19:52.608
So you really have nothing
to be thankful to me for. Believe me.

00:19:53.108 --> 00:19:55.235
He's doing it again.

00:19:55.319 --> 00:19:58.989
Anyone else who thinks they can try
to conquer the world without my permission

00:19:59.072 --> 00:20:00.741
is out of their fricking mind.

00:20:00.824 --> 00:20:04.453
I don't care if it's Kall-Su, or Abigail,

00:20:04.536 --> 00:20:06.538
or even Anthrasax.

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.127
I promise you they're dead.

00:20:14.421 --> 00:20:16.632
This… this is bad.

00:20:16.715 --> 00:20:19.885
I've never seen the orb react
like this in my entire life.

00:20:19.968 --> 00:20:21.428
My worst fears are manifesting.

00:20:21.511 --> 00:20:23.764
Empress Nei is already near the castle!

00:20:23.847 --> 00:20:25.766
She must have used the storm as cover.

00:20:30.771 --> 00:20:33.273
What… what are… What are you doing?

00:20:33.357 --> 00:20:37.152
I'm gonna show you the consequences
of visiting a man's room

00:20:37.236 --> 00:20:40.239
on a dark and stormy night,
all by your lonesome.

00:20:40.322 --> 00:20:42.574
No, please. I was just…

00:20:42.658 --> 00:20:44.326
I mean, I'm not that--

00:20:44.409 --> 00:20:46.620
-Come here. You're mine, Princess Sheila.
-Stop.

00:20:46.703 --> 00:20:47.996
Please, stop!

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.916
No! Stop, please!
Dark Schneider, you can't--

00:20:50.999 --> 00:20:52.292
Stop! Please, stop it!

00:20:52.376 --> 00:20:53.710
Stop it, please!

00:20:56.713 --> 00:20:59.049
No. Don't… Stop, please.

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:06.265
<i>Ugh. What's he doing to Sheila?</i>

00:21:07.474 --> 00:21:09.226
Even if your goal…

00:21:09.309 --> 00:21:10.352
Oh God.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:13.188
…is to conquer the world,

00:21:13.814 --> 00:21:14.856
I don't care.

00:21:15.482 --> 00:21:19.861
I'd still give my body to you
if that's what you desire.

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:21.780
Please, don't go.

00:21:21.863 --> 00:21:23.365
She's going to kill you.

00:21:23.448 --> 00:21:25.867
If you go, I'll never see you again.

00:21:25.951 --> 00:21:30.080
<i>I knew it.</i>
<i>She's totally in love with Lucien!</i>

00:21:32.416 --> 00:21:34.710
Oh, great Raijinken reborn,

00:21:34.793 --> 00:21:37.838
lend your power
so that the spell is carried out!

00:21:37.921 --> 00:21:40.257
Dei-vu Mu-staiine!

00:21:40.340 --> 00:21:44.177
<i>I'm not saying this</i>
<i>as a princess, but as a woman…</i>

00:21:46.305 --> 00:21:51.768
<i>I can't just stay here and watch</i>
<i>as the man I love goes to meet his death.</i>

00:21:55.439 --> 00:21:57.190
-Huh?
-You animal. Stop right there!

00:21:57.274 --> 00:21:58.275
Ow!

00:22:00.610 --> 00:22:02.696
The elementals are stirring.

00:22:03.238 --> 00:22:04.740
Could that mean…

00:22:05.699 --> 00:22:08.368
Oh, spirits
of the earth and the air,

00:22:08.452 --> 00:22:12.831
I summon you to honor your commitment
and to fulfill our pact!

00:22:14.166 --> 00:22:15.292
Megadeath!
